                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "I won this game in a giveaway.\n\nI think the store page tells you pretty well what kind of game this is. So on top of that, I just have a few more things to say.\n\nThe controls are a bit weird:\n- There is no jump button. You jump automatically if you approach any kind of ledge while moving fast.\n- The main character is only able to move as if on a grid. But this doesn't apply to many of the game's objects, projectiles and enemies.\n\nI'm also not a big fan that many of the levels require precise controls, not just sharp thinking.\n\nThat being said, I love 2D puzzle platformers and many of the puzzles here will stretch your brain quite a bit. That's worth a positive review.",
